  "description": "The 8bar GRUNEWALD Aluminium V1 is our answer to fast, modern “Gucci Gravel”.Built for riders who crave speed and push hard on long straights, it’s light, direct, and efficient — a frame with true fast DNA, made for rapid gravel rides, asphalt detours, and sporty adventures.\n\nCOMFORT & STIFFNESS\n\nAluminium efficiently transfers your power to the road without losses. With tire clearance of up to 47 mm (28\"), the GRUNEWALD offers just the right amount of added comfort without sacrificing direct handling or speed — ideal for fast surfaces and smooth gravel.\n\nCLEAN DESIGN & AERODYNAMICS\n\nInternal cable routing creates a clean, uncluttered look while reducing aerodynamic drag. The result is a sleek frame with improved aerodynamics for smooth, efficient riding at high speeds.\n\nPOWER & CONTROL\n\nWhether on fast descents or at gravel races, the reliable disc brakes deliver maximum control. The GRUNEWALD is the perfect choice for riders looking for a fast, gravel- and road-oriented frame that combines performance with confidence.\n\nEMBOSSED LOGOS\n\n8bar logos are embossed into the head tube and dropouts. Subtle, durable, and premium, the refined 3D effect underscores the minimalist character of the GRUNEWALD Aluminium V1.\n\nUDH READY\n\nThe GRUNEWALD Aluminium V1 is SRAM UDH-ready, making it fully prepared for modern drivetrain systems. This ensures better compatibility, easier service, and long-term future-proofing.",
